#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid "Matching tiles are such tiles where the face pictograms match exactly."
msgstr ""
"Pločice koje se podudataju su pločice gdje se lica piktograma u potpunosti "
"podudaraju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:161 index.docbook:171 index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Bilješka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are exceptions to this rule. In the traditional game of Mahjong each "
"tile has a matching one except for the <quote>Flowers</quote> and "
"<quote>Seasons</quote> tiles."
msgstr ""
"Postoje izuzeci za ovo pravilo. U tradicionalnoj igri Mahjong svaka pločica "
"ima jedan odgovarajući, osim za <quote> Cvijeće </quote> i <quote> Sezonske "
"</quote> pločice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <quote>Flowers</quote> tiles have no doubles in the set and can be "
"matched directly to each other."
msgstr ""
"<quote>Cvijetne</quote> pločice nemaju duplikata u setu i mogu biti upareni "
"direktno međusobno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <quote>Seasons</quote> tiles have no doubles in the set and can be "
"matched directly to each other."
msgstr ""
"<quote>Sezonske</quote> pločice nemaju duplikata u setu i mogu biti upareni "
"direktno međusobno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tiles can only be removed if they can be connected with a maximum of three "
"connected lines that do not cross any other tile. Lines can be horizontal or "
"vertical, but not diagonal."
msgstr ""
"Pločice mogu biti uklonjene samo ako se mogu povezati maksimalno sa tri "
"povezujuće linije koje ne prelaze preko drugih pločica. Linije mogu biti "
"horizontalne ili vertikalne, ali ne i dijagonalne."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You do not have to draw the lines by yourself, the game does this for you. "
"Just mark two matching tiles on the board, if they can be connected by a "
"line with at most two bends, the line is drawn and the tiles are removed."
msgstr ""
"Vi ne trebate crtati linije, igra to odradi za vas. Samo označite dvije "
"pločice koje se podudaraju na tabli, ako se mogu povezati s linijom sa "
"najviše dva zavoja, linija se nacrta i pločice se uklanjaju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lines may only cross empty areas of the board."
msgstr "Linije smiju samo preći prazne dijelove table."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some games are unsolvable. If you would like to avoid unsolvable games check "
"the option <guilabel>Create solvable games only</guilabel> in the "
"configuration dialog."
msgstr ""
"Neke igre su nerješive. Ako biste željeli izbjeći nerješive igre čekirajte "
"opciju <guilabel>Kreirajte samo rješive igrice</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The scores are awarded for the time the player needs to remove all the tiles "
"from the game board. Games with more tiles give more scores."
msgstr ""
"Bodovi se dodjeljuju za vrijeme koje igraču treba da ukloni sve pločice sa "
"table. Igre s više pločica daju više bodova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you played with the <guilabel>Gravity</guilabel> setting enabled, the "
"score will be doubled."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste igrali sa <guilabel>Gravitacija</guilabel> postavke uključene, skor "
"će biti uduplan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To be eligible for a place amongst the high scores player has to complete a "
"game instance within the shortest period of time possible."
msgstr ""
"Da bi bili podobni za mjesto među igračima sa visokim skorom morate završi "
"igru instance u najkraćem mogućem roku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the player uses the <quote>Undo</quote> or <quote>Hint</quote> feature "
"the record will not be considered as a high score."
msgstr ""
"Ako igrač koristi <quote>Poništi</quote> ili <quote>Pomoć</quote> zapisani "
"rekord neće biti uzet u obzir kao visoki skor."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "Savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on a tile with the &RMB; to highlight all matching tiles on the board. "
"Unlike using the <quote>Undo</quote> or <quote>Hint</quote> feature, this "
"help is allowed without being considered cheating."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na pločice sa &RMB; da istakne sve odgovaraju pločice na ploči. Za "
"razliku koristeći <quote>Poništi</quote> ili <quote>Pomoć</quote> funkcija, "
"ova pomoć je dozvoljena bez da se smatra varanjem."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "Pregled izgleda igre"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Game Menu"
msgstr "Menu igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu lets you control the status of the current "
"game:"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> meni dozvoljava da kontrolišete status trenutne igre:"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Finishes the current game</action> and starts a new session with new "
"tiles."
msgstr ""
"<action>Završava trenutnu igru</action> i počinje novu sesiju sa novim "
"pločicama."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>F5</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Restart Game</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>F5</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Restartuj igru</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Restarts the current game with the same tiles."
msgstr "Restartuje trenutnu igru sa istim pločicama."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Pauza</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Pauses the game</action>, especially the timer which affects the "
"scoring. The menu entry is also used for resuming the game."
msgstr ""
"<action>Pauzira igru</action>, pogotovo tajmer koji utiče na krajnji skor. "
"Stavka izbornika se koristi i za nastavak igre."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show High Scores</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prikaži najbolje rezultate</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows your top ten charts of &kappname;."
msgstr "Pokazuje vam top 10 grafikona &kappname;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Izlaz</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kappname;."
msgstr "<action>Izađi</action> &kappname;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some of the menu items can also be controlled by keyboard shortcuts. See "
"<xref linkend=\"key-bindings\"/> for a list."
msgstr ""
"Neke od stavki izbornika mogu biti kontrolisane od strane kratisa sa "
"tastature.  Vidite <xref linkend=\"key-bindings\"/> za listu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Move Menu"
msgstr "Pokretni meni"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Potez</guimenu><guimenuitem>Poništi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Undoes the last step</action>. Same as the <guibutton>Undo</"
"guibutton> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<action>Poništava zadnji korak</action>. Isto kao i  <guibutton>Undo</"
"guibutton> dugme na traci alata."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Redo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Pomjeri</guimenu><guimenuitem>Vrati</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Redoes the last step</action>. Same as the <guibutton>Redo</"
"guibutton> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<action>Vraća zadnji korak</action>. Isto kao i <guibutton>Vrati</guibutton> "
"button in the toolbar."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Pomjeri</guimenu><guimenuitem>Pomoć</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Shows a hint</action>, which two tiles to remove next."
msgstr ""
"<action>Pokazuje pomoć</action>, koje dvije pločice da uklonite sljedeće."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Settings Menu"
msgstr "Meni Postavke"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Play Sounds</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Izvodi zvukove</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Plays a sound when you touch a tile by clicking with it the &LMB; and when a "
"tile is falling down playing with <guilabel>Gravity</guilabel> enabled."
msgstr ""
"Svira kada dotaknete pločicu tako što kliknete sa &LMB; i kada pločica pada "
"sviranje je <guilabel>Gravity</guilabel> omogućeno."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kappname;...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens the <link linkend=\"configuration\">configuration dialog</link> to "
"change &kappname; settings."
msgstr ""
"Otvara <link linkend=\"configuration\">konfiguracijski dijalog</link> da "
"promijeni &kappname; postavke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kshisen; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Pored ovog &kshisen; ima standardne &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavke menija, za više informacija pročitaj sekcije "
"o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Meniju postavki</"
"ulink> i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Meniju pomoći</"
"ulink> od &kde; osnova."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljena pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change the way &kappname; looks use the <link linkend=\"game-"
"settings-settings\">menubar</link> to open the <link linkend=\"configuration"
"\">configuration utility</link>."
msgstr ""
"Da. Da promijenite način na koji &kappname; izgleda koristite <link linkend="
"\"game-settings-settings\">menubar</link> da otvorite <link linkend="
"\"configuration\">konfiguraciju programa</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastaturu?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. This game does not feature a keyboard play mode."
msgstr "Ne. Ova igra ne podržava režim igre sa tastaturom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"Moram da napustim igru, ali još nisam završio. Da li mogu da snimim napredak?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. This game does not feature a <quote>Save</quote> option."
msgstr "Ne. Ova igra ne sadrži <quote>Save</quote> opciju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"&kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item will open a configuration "
"dialog which lets you alter the behavior of the game."
msgstr ""
"Izborom <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši "
"&kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> stavke izbornika će otvoriti "
"dijalog konfiguracije koja vam omogućuje da promijenite ponašanje igre."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kappname; configuration dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kappname; konfiguracijski dijalog</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kappname; configuration dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kappname; konfiguracijski dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>General</guilabel> page"
msgstr "<guilabel>Opšte</guilabel> stranica"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gravity"
msgstr "Gravitacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Checking this makes the game even harder: If a tile is removed, all tiles "
"lying above it will fall down one step."
msgstr ""
"Označavanje ovoga čini igru težom: Ako je pločica uklonjena, sve pločice "
"koje leže iznad nje će pasti jedan korak dolje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create solvable games only"
msgstr "Kreiraj samo rješive igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, you will only be presented with games that are possible to "
"solve. Note: Even in solvable games you can fail to complete if you remove "
"the tiles in the wrong order."
msgstr ""
"Ako je označeno, biće vam predstavljene samo igre koje je moguće riješiti. "
"Poruka: Čak i kod rješivih igara se može desiti da ne uspijete, ako uklonite "
"pločice pogrešnim redoslijedom."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use Chinese style: any flower match any flower, any season match any season"
msgstr "Kineski način: svi cvjetovi se međusobno poklapaju, kao i sva doba"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:390
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the traditional rules for matching the tiles. Previous version of "
"&kappname; used to allow only exact tiles matches, which is inconsistent "
"with Mahjong rules. It is recommended to keep this option checked."
msgstr ""
"Koristite tradicionalna pravila za podudaranje pločica. Prethodna verzija "
"&kappname; dozvoljavala je samo potpuno podudaranje pločica, što je suprotno "
"sa pravilima Mahjonga. Preporučljivo je da ova opcija bude čekirana."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tiles can slide, but you can connect only in 2 lines instead of 3"
msgstr "Pločice klizaju, ali povezivanje samo s dvije umesto tri linije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option changes the rules to the point where it almost becomes a "
"completely different game. When it is active, you can remove the tiles only "
"if they can be connected by a line consisting of one or two segments instead "
"of the customary three. However, you are allowed to slide the tiles on the "
"board, if the row or column where they are placed has some empty space. To "
"make a sliding move, you have to click first on the tile in the column or "
"row that can slide, and then on the matching tile. If there are two possible "
"sliding moves, blue lines are shown indicating these moves. You then have to "
"click on one of the two lines to choose your preferred move."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija mijenja pravila do te granice da skoro postaje sasvim druga "
"igrica. Kada je aktivna, možete uklanjati one pločice  samo ako se mogu "
"povezati linijom koja sadrži jednu ili dva segmenta, umjesto uobičajna tri. "
"Međutim, dopušteno vam je kliziti sa pločicama po tabli, ako red ili kolora, "
"gdje su pozicionirane, ima praznog prostora. Da napravite klizanje, morate "
"prvo kliknuti na plicu u koloni ili redu koji može kliziti, zatim na "
"podudarajuću pločicu. Ako su moguća dva klizeća pokreta, plave linije "
"pokazuju ove pokrete. Ona vi treba da kliknete na jednu od tih linija da "
"odaberete željeni pokret."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid "Board Difficulty"
msgstr "Težina table"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The slider controls the difficulty of the board (i.e. how much the tiles are "
"shuffled) from <guilabel>Easy</guilabel> to <guilabel>Hard</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Klizač kontrolica težinu table (i.e. koliko su pločice izmješane)od "
"<guilabel>Lako</guilabel> do <guilabel>Teško</guilabel>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid "Piece Removal Speed"
msgstr "Brzina uklanjanja domina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adjusting this slider alters the speed at which the pieces are removed from "
"the screen after a match has been made."
msgstr ""
"Podešavanje ovog klizača mijenja brzinu kojom se domine uklanjaju sa ekrana "
"nakon što su uparene."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "Board Size"
msgstr "Veličina table"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This slider allows you to change the number of tiles on the board. The more "
"tiles you have, the harder (and longer) the game will be."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj klizač vam omogućava da promijenite broj pločica na tabli. Što više "
"pločica imate, teža (i duža) igra će biti."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Tiles</guilabel> and <guilabel>Background</guilabel> page"
msgstr "<guilabel>Pločice</guilabel> i <guilabel>Pozadina</guilabel> stranica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:438
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select you favorite design for tiles and background."
msgstr "Selektijte vaš omiljeni dizajn za pločice i pozadinu."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Pomoc"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens &kappname; help pages (this document)."
msgstr "Otvori &kappname; pomoćne stranice(ovaj dokument)."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>OK</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>U redu</guibutton>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:452
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves your changes and closes the dialog."
msgstr "Spašava vaše promjene i zatvara dijalog."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Primjeni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves your changes but does not close the dialog."
msgstr "Spašava vaše promjene, ali ne zatvara dijalog."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:465
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Otkaži"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:466
#, no-c-format
msgid "Discards all your changes and closes the dialog."
msgstr "Odbacuje sve vaše promjene i zatvara dijalog."

